WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.872
Counting matches is another common pattern.

00:00:02.872 --> 00:00:05.102
The counter starts at zero.

00:00:05.102 --> 00:00:09.012
Each measurement is checked against ninety-eight point six.

00:00:09.012 --> 00:00:12.865
When the condition is true, the counter increases by one.

00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:20.569
With the current values, ninety-nine point four and one hundred point two are above the threshold,

00:00:20.569 --> 00:00:23.344
so the final count should be two.

00:00:23.344 --> 00:00:33.423
The exact threshold can represent anything: response time, sales amount, temperature, score, or another business rule.
